  "description": "Retired E2E manifest test ids. Each key is an id that no manifest declares any more; its value names the live id that now carries the same program and cells. This file is the only way a historical id resolves: history readers (ci/compat-envelope/scorecard.rs and the dev-hermit series, census and website readers) map a retired id through it so an old-id row and a new-id row join into one cell history. Every value must be a live id, no key may be live, and no two keys may share a value. Every value keeps its key's test name under the successor bucket unless the key is listed in that retirement's collisions, which says why the plain rename could not be used.",
